OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AChina probes use of formaldehyde to
OL,4,Akeep cabbages fresh
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn environmental blogger first released
OL,7,Fthe footage last week. Using
OL,8,Fformaldehyde, a colourless chemical
OL,9,Fused for preserving biological
OL,10,Fspecimens that is known to cause
OL,11,Fcancer, for keeping food fresh is
OL,12,Fstrictly prohibited in China.
OL,14,FChina is the world's largest producer
OL,15,Fof cabbages, most of which are exported
OL,16,Fto neighbouring countries in Asia.
